# NOIT AI Declaration — local capture and personal data stay untracked.
# .noit/config.local.json holds PII (name, ЕГН, class, school, city) and
# .noit/config.backup.*.json holds pre-migration copies; never commit them.
# The full .noit/export/ package also contains personal data (declaration.md
# prints ЕГН), so it is no longer tracked. Only the designated public,
# PII-free export directory .noit/public/ may be committed.
.noit/*
!.noit/public/
.noit/config.local.json
.noit/config.backup.*.json
